Bind forward = substituteMeaning(left, right, sources) and reverse = substituteMeaning(right, left, sources). Equivalent requires preserved obligations and consequences in both directions on representative supported situations. One-way success suggests narrower/overlap, not sameness. Read explicit team objections and retain the counterexample that defines a refused boundary. Return witnesses, relation and unresolved evidence; do not let a sponsor preference substitute for demonstrated equivalence.
